<fo:block id="W0043-07-0118-pa-0b04" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline baseline-shift="super" font-size="9pt" font-weight="bold" id="#W0043-07-0118-nm-06fb"><fo:basic-link color="#0a0c75" internal-destination="W0043-07-0118-nm-06fb">787</fo:basic-link></fo:inline><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Hoc mihi indubitatum. Quamuis enim Eccle<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ia definierit, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>emel tantùm in diebus ieiunij e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e comedendum, prandij autem quantitatem nec definiuit, nec definire potuit commodè propter varias hominum complexiones.</fo:block>
