<fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>DVBIVM LXVI.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align="center" font-size="20pt" font-weight="normal" space-before="5mm"><fo:inline padding-left="0.2cm" padding-right="0.2cm" font-size="20pt" font-weight="normal"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic">An Quadrage<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>imale ieiunium <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it ex<fo:inline> </fo:inline>iure diuino?</fo:inline></fo:inline></fo:block>
