<fo:block id="W0043-07-0191-it-0803" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-family="serif" font-size="18pt" space-before="0.1mm" space-after="0.1mm">C</fo:inline>Arnium nomine quid veniat intelligendum. p. 70. n. 5. &amp; 6</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0191-it-0804" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Habens licentiam edendi Carnes, pote<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t ouis<fo:inline> </fo:inline>ve<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ci, &amp; <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ic de reliquis. ibid. num. 9. 10<fo:inline> </fo:inline>11. 12. 13. 14</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0191-it-0805" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Nùm Carnis nomine oua, ac lacticinia prohibeantur. p. 83. n. 132</fo:block></fo:block></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0191-it-06db" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:block id="W0043-07-0191-li-067a">
