<fo:block id="W0043-07-0196-it-08ff" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>An po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it dari vt viaticum Euchari<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tia pueris<fo:inline> </fo:inline>quando de earum capacitate dubitatur?<fo:inline> </fo:inline>pag. 60. num. 39</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0196-it-0900" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>An ex <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>piritu Eccle<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>iæ con<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ulendus <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it omnibus fidelibus indifferenter v<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>us quotidianus Euchari<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tiæ. pag. 64. n. 66. &amp;<fo:inline> </fo:inline>67. &amp; p. 65. n. 68</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0196-it-0901" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Sufficitne ad præcepti huius impletionem<fo:inline> </fo:inline>Euchari<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tiam in Cathedrali Eccle<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ia <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>u<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>cipere? p. 66. n. 72</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0196-it-0902" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Euchari<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tiam peregrini recipientes in Mendicantium Eccle<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>iis implentne annuę communionis præceptum. ibidem<fo:inline> </fo:inline>numero 75</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0196-it-0903" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>An Mendicantes po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>int in <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>uis Eccle<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>iis Euchari<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tiam <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>æcularibus cunctis in Palchate ad præceptum implendum mini<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>trare?<fo:inline> </fo:inline>ibid. n. 78</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0196-it-0904" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>An Parocho deficiente, vel nolente Euchari<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tiam <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ubditis mini<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>trare ad implendum<fo:inline> </fo:inline>annuæ confe<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ionis præceptum, po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>int Religio<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i eam <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>æcularibus impertire?<fo:inline> </fo:inline>p. 68. n. 87</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0196-it-0905" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>untne Reliogio<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i Euchari<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tiam in Pa<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>chate<fo:inline> </fo:inline>mini<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>trare familiaribus actualiter Religio<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>is<fo:inline> </fo:inline>in<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>eruientibus. ib. n. 90</fo:block></fo:block></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0196-it-07db" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:block id="W0043-07-0196-li-068c">
<fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic">Eugenius IV.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0196-it-0907" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Eugenius IV. excu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ans artifices artem <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>uam<fo:inline font-style="normal" id="W0043-07-0197-pb-04b6"/><fo:inline role="W0043-07-0197-pb-04b6" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="12pt">[[175]]</fo:inline><fo:inline> </fo:inline>exercentes à ieiunij obligatione, comprehenditne eos qui artes laborio<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>as non exercent. p. 114. n. 432</fo:block></fo:block></fo:block></fo:block></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-it-06b2" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-li-0562">
<fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>F</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-it-07de" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-li-068e">
<fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic">Famulus.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-it-090a" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-family="serif" font-size="18pt" space-before="0.1mm" space-after="0.1mm">F</fo:inline>Amuli quo titulo excu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>entur, qui vt dominis <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>uis mini<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>trent Mi<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>am omittunt?<fo:inline> </fo:inline>p. 6. n. 44</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-it-090b" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Famuli quandonam debeant dominos deferre. ibidem</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-it-090c" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Famuli excu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>anturne ab<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>olute, qui vt obediant heris aliquod Mi<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>æ tempore imperantibus, eam non exaudiunt. p. 32.<fo:inline> </fo:inline>numero 286</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-it-090d" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Famulis augere portionem tenenturne domini, quæ alias non <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ufficit, vt ieiunare valeant. p 112. n. 408</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-it-090e" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>An Famulos <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>uos po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it compellere dominus<fo:inline> </fo:inline>ad præceptum Ieiunij <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>eruandum. p. 125.<fo:inline> </fo:inline>n. 539. &amp; 540</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-it-090f" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Famulis ieiunare nolentibus tenetur dominus cœnam non impertire. pag. 126.<fo:inline> </fo:inline>numero 543</fo:block></fo:block></fo:block></fo:block></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-it-06ba" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:block id="W0043-07-0197-li-0564">
<fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>I</fo:block>
