<fo:block id="W0043-07-0203-it-0a7d" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Pueri cum primum rationis v<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>um fuerint con<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ecuti, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ingulis annis Confiteri tenentur.<fo:inline> </fo:inline>p. 37. num. 2</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0203-it-0a7e" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Pueri diligenter examinandi, num capaces <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>int<fo:inline> </fo:inline>ab<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>olutionis recipiendę. ibidem numero 3.</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0203-it-0a7f" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Et quid circa id faciendum. ibid.</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0203-it-0a80" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>An Pueri non implentes confe<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ionis annuæ<fo:inline> </fo:inline>præceptum incurrant pœnas tran<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>gre<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>oribus præ<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>criptas. p. 53. n. 122</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0203-it-0a81" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Pueri ad lucrandum iubilęum ieiunare debent<fo:inline> </fo:inline>p. 78. n. 77</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0203-it-0a82" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Pueri po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t rationis v<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>um ad ciborum qualitatem obligantur. ib. n. 78</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0203-it-0a83" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Si Puer ante <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>eptẽnium v<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>u polleat rationis, licetne ei in diebus prohibitis carnibus, aut<fo:inline> </fo:inline>lacticiniis ve<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ci. pagina 87. numero 167</fo:block></fo:block></fo:block></fo:block></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0043-07-0203-it-082e" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:block id="W0043-07-0203-li-0583">
